data: {"id": "5a5e1f962036489a-thinking-layer-291", "run_id": "5a5e1f962036489a", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod PendingUnschedulable / 调度失败\n\n> Pod异常类型: PendingUnschedulable | 典型状态: Pending | 兼容分类: scheduling\n\n## 场景识别\n\n| 信号 | 关键特征 |\n|------|----------|\n| Pod 状态 | Pending，且 Events 含 `FailedSchedul", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789111626144}

